.SS " bool charset_normalizer\&.api\&.is_binary (PathLike | str | BinaryIO | bytes fp_or_path_or_payload, int  steps = \fC5\fP, int  chunk_size = \fC512\fP, float  threshold = \fC0\&.20\fP, list[str] | None  cp_isolation = \fCNone\fP, list[str] | None  cp_exclusion = \fCNone\fP, bool  preemptive_behaviour = \fCTrue\fP, bool  explain = \fCFalse\fP, float  language_threshold = \fC0\&.1\fP, bool  enable_fallback = \fCFalse\fP)"

.PP
.nf
Detect if the given input (file, bytes, or path) points to a binary file\&. aka\&. not a string\&.
